 "result": "I documented 12 repos this run and pushed the changes to each. I did not check that the scribe-publish workflow created the releases. I also did not check the live sites after the pushes.\n\nFour were new backfills: delivery-twin, mail-ionaire, thanks-for-watching and 2026-11-11-orange-codelens. Eight had new commits: downfree-foundry, smash-bender, song-offset-listener, mill-ionaire, pajamastan, 2026-10-18-orange-testbed, parcelsun-kq and field-twin. Pushes went to each repo's default branch, which is master for delivery-twin, mail-ionaire, field-twin and pajamastan. None of the four backfills needed a new vercel.json, because delivery-twin, mail-ionaire and codelens have a root index.html and thanks-for-watching already has a vercel.json.\n\nI rebuilt the profile README in sudosilo/sudosilo and pushed it. The \"scribe state\" commit to control-troll main holds state.json, repos.json, publish.json and the notes.\n\nNo backfills remain, apart from the three agent repos (control-troll, heckle-troll and sudosilo) that are skipped on purpose and a few empty or forked repos. The next run still has real work. The combined creator seal commit also hit infinicanvan, flipcount-game, termbeat, tractor-tool and torque-converter. The Sky Flow commit in 2026-10-30-orange-scores is also waiting, and other repos have bot-only commits.\n\nI reached every repo, and none were archived. The testbed push printed a status check notice but still landed.\n\nagents/notes/general.md is now 57 lines, over the 40-line limit, and I did not condense it.",
